uires `namespace` presence for all cloudmanager controller logs without the cluster-scoped qualification that E001 carries. This is a completeness nit on a secondary rule (an empty-string namespace satisfies both the AC and the strategy rule); recorded as a minor issue. No docs-authoring gap: the Prerequisites section lists \"Pending human review\" rather than \"Documentation Support: Yes\", and a docs-authoring epic (E003) exists regardless, covering HLR-8.\n46\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9f61a197868ca609","agent_id":"a6fb2e371bd48465e","session_id":"326616fc-8f4b-4f48-9d9b-9ede56865310","uuid":"26b27a96-ecf5-40bb-82d2-c3f599d7d475","timestamp":"2026-10-26T18:38:40.948Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-99b1a9b049d387e7","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-8010 decomposition"}
